  dumb how am i supposed to be in a  relationship with somebody thinks it's  the greatest literary achievement of our  time  is dumb and if you want to discover all  the easter eggs and incredible details  you missed in p.s i still love you as  well  tap here to watch that video or follow  the link in the video description  so what did you think of always and  forever did you like the ending and were  there any other interesting details you  noticed  leave your thoughts in the comments  below and if you enjoyed this video then  i really appreciate a thumbs up  tap left to watch my next netflix video  or tap right for something else you're  sure to like  thanks for watching and see you next  time yupikai movie lovers

